            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yobu yairamu Musengwa Katonda ng'akoba ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho bwe yamala okwogera ni Yobu ebibono ebyo, yaakoba Elifazi Omutemani ati: “Nkusungughaliire inho iwe ni baino bombi, kuba timundhogeireeku bituufu ng'oti n'omugheereza wange Yobu bw'ayogeire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni, mpegaano mutwale ente enume musanvu, n'entaama enume musanvu eri omugheereza wange Yobu, mugheeyo ku lwaimwe ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa. Omugheereza wange Yobu aidha kubasabira, era ndidha kuganha by'anaabasabira, ndobe kubakolaku ng'obusirusiru bwaimwe bwebubagwaniza. Kuba timundhogeireeku bituufu ng'oti n'omugheereza wange Yobu bw'ayogeire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Elifazi Omutemani, ni Bilidadi Omushuhi, ni Zefari Omunaamathi, baaja, baakola nga Musengwa Katonda bwe yabalagira. Era Musengwa Katonda yaaganha okuwulira Yobu bye yabasabira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
